      "modifications": "Coordinated humanoid bind-space vertex and joint proportions; human face reshaped into a sealed internal neck connector and toes removed; preserved shoulder peaks and continuous thighs; authored animal_aurochs head with closed rear crop and hoof topology aligned to exact foot bind centers, retaining original UVs and atlas; cropped source peasant waist cloth; source axe held at lower haft with broad blade facing outward; eight retargeted source clips and whole-mesh floor corrections; reinforced upper torso, shortened forward horns, source plate armor and shield"
    }
